From: samQEq package
Subject: [PATCH] fix_efield: befriend FixQEqBaseSam (samQEq ACKS2/QEq base)

The samQEq solver base (src/SAMQEQ/fix_qeq_base_sam) reads FixEfield's per-atom
external field to add it to the electronegativity, exactly as the upstream
qeq/reaxff family does (FixQEqReaxFF / FixQtpieReaxFF are already friends). This
one-line core change grants the same friend access to FixQEqBaseSam.

fix_efield is a CORE LAMMPS fix (src/fix_efield.h, always built), so this is a
core-to-core change and introduces no package dependency. Apply from the LAMMPS
src/ directory:

    cd lammps/src
    patch -p1 < /path/to/samQEq/patches/fix_efield-friend.patch
    #   or:  git apply /path/to/samQEq/patches/fix_efield-friend.patch

--- a/src/fix_efield.h
+++ b/src/fix_efield.h
@@ -26,6 +26,7 @@ namespace LAMMPS_NS {
 class FixEfield : public Fix {
   friend class FixQEqReaxFF;
   friend class FixQEqRelReaxFF;
   friend class FixQtpieReaxFF;
+  friend class FixQEqBaseSam;    // SAMQEQ: same efield coupling as the qeq/reaxff family

  public:
